{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都3日間ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はさゆちゃんとペア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘さと辛さの入り混じった\nさゆちゃんの握手\n見てて楽しかったです☻"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へんなかお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース:CHILD WOMAN"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回から京都2部制だね、わーい！\nってお話が多かったかな？☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は私の元気の源ヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29日の握手でやるって言ってた\n仮装なんだけど\n1着はもう出来てて、予定通り着ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の仮装か秘密にしようと\n思ってたんだけど\n絶対伝わらなくて\nそれの説明で終わりそうだから\nやっぱり言うね。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カールじいさんに出てくる\nケビンという鳥の仮装です！(笑)\n調べてみてね！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2着目作り始めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカ5人でお揃いしたいね～って\n話してて( *｀ω´)\nこれから5着作ります...間に合うかな...\n間に合わなかったらごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間に合わせます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大原櫻子ちゃんのライブに\n行ってきました～～( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギリギリまで行けるか\n分からなかったんだけど\nなんとか行くことができて幸せ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂入ってから行ったライブは\nBerryz工房さんとこの大原櫻子ちゃんで\n2回目だったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでこういう風に話すんだなあ～とか\n曲の繋がりで\nこういうことをするんだ～とか\n昔とは違う見方をしてしまいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のアーティストさんのライブは\n本当に勉強になります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パワフルでかわいい\n大原櫻子ちゃんの歌声は\nいつも私のパワーになってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またライブあったら絶対行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は玲香ちゃんver.の\n嫌われ松子の一生を観劇してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香ちゃんとちーちゃん☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレになるから詳しくは言えないけど\nすごい！の一言かなあ(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香ちゃんのあの迫力...\nさすがだなあ...すごいなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の語彙力だとうまく伝えられないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なだぎ武さんのアドリブも\nすごく面白かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香ちゃんも若様も\n残りの公演頑張ってくださいー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい遊んでばっかりみたいな\nブログになってしまいましたが\n毎日お仕事させてもらってます！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心してください！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は早起きでお仕事なので\nお風呂に入ってすぐ寝まーすzzz"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/10/06/6264225/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}